OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry with clear spells and
OL,7,Fturning a bit chilly in places. Cloud
OL,8,Fwill soon increase with outbreaks of
OL,9,Frain, some heavy, following from the
OL,10,Fwest towards dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FCloudy with rain and drizzle
OL,13,Fclear east during the morning. Staying
OL,14,Frather cloudy, especially in the
OL,15,Fsouthwest with some patchy drizzle,
OL,16,Fbut some bright warm spells developing
OL,17,Fin the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
