OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FCloud
OL,6,Fand rain, some heavy, will move in
OL,7,Ffrom the northwest Tuesday afternoon
OL,8,Fbecoming heavy overnight. Becoming
OL,9,Fdrier later Wednesday and into
OL,10,FThursday. Further rain from the
OL,11,Fnorthwest later Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
